{
  "page": "thps2_recomp.html",
  "header": [
    "Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 2's extended plan for play_page.mjs, about 280 s in Chrome and Firefox, 5 minutes at most: the regular plan",
    "to The Hangar and its 80 s there (Load ROM in the page's picker, A on the Expansion Pak notice, START through the legal",
    "text and the logos to the main menu, A through CAREER MODE, NEW CAREER, the first skater and his menu to the level",
    "select and The Hangar's goals, each press repeated until the word at 0x800FD5AC, which counts the front end's screens,",
    "moves, then A until the run starts: gRunActive, 0x800DBF70, is 1), then two more courses of the career, NY City and",
    "Venice Beach, about 27 s each. A new career has only The Hangar open, so before leaving it the plan writes 1 to the",
    "game's own all-levels word (0x800E854C, which Level_IsSelectable reads first), then goes as a player does: START, END",
    "RUN, A past the statistics, LEVEL SELECT, Right to the course (the select keeps its cursor on the last one), A through",
    "its goals to the run. Each run's start is a need that gRunActive is 1 and the course word at 0x800E84D4 is the one",
    "asked for (0 The Hangar, 3 NY City, 4 Venice Beach). The skating is the regular plan's: pushing on, turns each way,",
    "ollies, a flip and a grab. Its waits and holds in the courses are on the game's frame counter (0x800F5854, 30 a second",
    "of the game's time), so each browser gives the game the same input for the same game time; the menus between are on",
    "the browser's."
  ],
